{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"耶利米書","commonName":"耶利米書","title":"耶利米書","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"681b5a173916e28ae5f3b5c6bb5d16263b7d167f21a486ef3c62ed1ab29150f3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：「以色列啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如果你回轉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"回轉歸向我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從我眼前除掉可憎的神像，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再離開我；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如果你本著誠實、正直、公義，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"憑永活的耶和華起誓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必成為萬國的祝福，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"得到他們的尊敬","poem":1},{"noteId":1},{"text":"。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華對猶大人和耶路撒冷人說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「要開墾你們的荒地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要在荊棘中撒種。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猶大人和耶路撒冷的居民啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要自行割禮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除掉心中的污垢，歸向耶和華。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不然，我必因你們的惡行而發烈怒，如火燃燒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人能夠撲滅。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"「你們要在猶大傳講，在耶路撒冷宣告，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『要在全國吹響號角。』","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"高聲呼喊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『要集合起來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們要逃進堅城。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要向錫安舉起旗幟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"趕快逃亡，不要遲延，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我要從北方降下災禍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大肆毀滅。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毀滅列國者已出動，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如獅子衝出巢穴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要使你們的土地荒涼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城邑淪為廢墟，無人居住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為此，你們要腰束麻布，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"嚎啕大哭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華向我們發的烈怒還沒有止息。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["耶和華說：「到那天，君王必嚇壞，官長必喪膽，祭司和先知必驚駭。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我說：「唉！主耶和華啊，你完全欺騙了這群百姓和耶路撒冷人，因為你說，『你們會安享太平。』其實劍鋒已抵著他們的咽喉了。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["那時，耶和華必對這群百姓和耶路撒冷人說：「一陣熱風從荒野光禿的山頭吹向我的子民，不是為揚場、吹淨糠秕。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["那是我發出的一陣強風。現在我要宣告我對他們的審判。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"看啊，仇敵必如雲湧來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的戰車快如旋風，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的戰馬比飛鷹還快。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們有禍了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們滅亡了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要洗去你內心的邪惡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這樣你才能得救。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你心懷惡念要到何時呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從但傳來消息，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從以法蓮山區報出惡訊。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：「你們去通知列國，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向耶路撒冷宣告，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『圍攻的人從遠方來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向猶大的城邑高聲喊殺，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像看守田園一樣包圍耶路撒冷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶路撒冷背叛了我。』","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的所作所為給你招致這災禍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是罪有應得，你會痛徹心肺！」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"我的心啊，我的心啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我傷心欲絕，煩躁不安。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我無法保持緘默，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我聽見了號角聲和戰爭的吶喊。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惡訊頻傳，山河破碎，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的帳篷忽然倒塌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"幔子頃刻破裂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我還要看這旌旗、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"聽這號聲到何時呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：「我的子民愚頑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不認識我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是蒙昧無知的兒女，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"善於行惡，不知行善。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我俯瞰大地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只見一片空虛混沌；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我觀看天空，毫無亮光。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我眺望群山，只見大山在顫抖，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"小山在搖晃。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我四下觀看，只見杳無人煙，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"飛鳥絕跡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我四下觀看，只見良田變荒野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城邑都在耶和華的烈怒下淪為廢墟。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：「遍地將要荒涼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而我不會徹底毀滅大地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，地要悲哀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天要昏暗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我言出必行，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我心意已決，絕不反悔。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各城的人聽到騎兵和弓箭手的吶喊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都紛紛逃命。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有的跑入叢林，有的爬進巖洞。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各城荒棄，無人居住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你這荒涼的城啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你在做什麼？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"縱然你穿上紅袍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"戴上金飾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"描眉畫眼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又有什麼用呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的情人藐視你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要殺害你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我聽見好像婦人分娩時的喊叫聲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像婦人生頭胎時的痛苦呻吟。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那是少女錫安的喊叫聲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她在喘息，伸出雙手說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「噢！我有禍了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要死在殺戮者手上了。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":1,"caller":"+","text":"「你必成為萬國的祝福，得到他們的尊敬」或譯「萬國必得到耶和華的祝福，並以祂為榮」。","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":2}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":31}